```css
/* === (a) src/styles.css @theme additions === */
@theme {
  /* --- Radius scale (make the DESIGN.md `rounded:` block REAL) ---
   * Tailwind v4 keys the rounded-* utilities off the `--radius-*` NAMESPACE,
   * NOT the singular `--radius`. The existing `--radius: 6px` is DEAD: nothing
   * references var(--radius) and it does not feed any utility, so every
   * rounded-sm / rounded-md / rounded (bare) currently resolves to Tailwind's
   * STOCK defaults (sm 4px, md 6px, lg 8px, bare 4px) — not the design system.
   * Defining the namespace overrides those utilities app-wide:
   */
  --radius-sm:   5px;     /* DESIGN.md rounded.sm — buttons, inputs, pills, chips */
  --radius-md:   7px;     /* DESIGN.md rounded.md — cards / plate */
  --radius-full: 9999px;  /* DESIGN.md rounded.full (matches stock; pinned for intent) */
  /* DELETE the singular `--radius: 6px` (dead — no var(--radius) consumers). */

  /* --- Scrim token for modal backdrops --- */
  --color-scrim: oklch(0.05 0 0 / 0.65);  /* generates the `bg-scrim` utility */

  /* --- Accent de-duplication ---
   * Was a duplicated literal `oklch(0.555 0.150 38)`; alias it so there is one
   * terracotta source of truth. `text-print-accent`/`bg-print-accent` still work. */
  --color-print-accent: var(--color-accent);
}
```

Utilities this generates / changes:
- `rounded-sm` → 5px, `rounded-md` → 7px (was stock 6px), bare `rounded` is UNAFFECTED (v4 bare rounded = its own 0.25rem default, independent of `--radius-*`); decide explicitly (openQuestion).
- new `bg-scrim` (and `border-scrim` etc.) from `--color-scrim`.
- `--color-print-accent` keeps generating `*-print-accent` utilities, now value-identical to `*-accent` by construction.

Also fold `.card { border-radius: 12px }` (styles.css:175) onto the scale — see openQuestions (12px is off the 5/7 scale; either becomes `rounded-md`/7px or a named `--radius-card`).

